# docker/Dockerfile intentionally has no static USER instruction: it starts
# as root so entrypoint.sh can remap the "evictarr" user to the host's
# PUID/PGID and chown /config, then gosu drops to that unprivileged user
# for the actual app process. See docker/entrypoint.sh and the matching
# #checkov:skip=CKV_DOCKER_3 comment in docker/Dockerfile.
AVD-DS-0002
